  "body": "## Changelog\r\n\r\n* 460c040fb Run existing cluster tests in CMX (#6069)\r\n* 2b9fd81d9 chore(deps): bump chainguard-dev/actions (#6070)\r\n* 7814c188a fix(snapshots): apply uploaded CA cert in Admin Console store validation (sc-139285) (#6067)\r\n* 2f0a61934 Bump OPA 1.18.2 to 1.20.2 (#6068)\r\n* 9e69075a7 Bump schemahero 0.26.1 to 0.26.2 (#6066)\r\n* 6075f0d0f chore(deps): bump go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/otlp/otlptrace (#6064)\r\n* a88c94b00 Bump rqlite from 10.2.7 to 10.3.4 (#6065)\r\n* c9d284505 Resolve CVEs (#6063)\r\n* 9f1b08509 Replace app slug validation with customer ID validation (#6061)\r\n* 1afedb712 SC-139506: Allow dots in linter config option name matching (#6060)\r\n* 055e08649 chore(deps): bump chainguard-dev/actions (#6059)\r\n* 8118ebbc9 fix: preserve raw license data for airgap Helm values (#6056)\r\n* 79d8eca4f [deps] Dependency update: web (#6053)\r\n\r\n"
